oṃ namo gaṇapataye ||

{atha subodhamañjarī likhyate} ||


<p. 245a> samyagbodhavicāreṇa bhāvanāma svabhāvataḥ |
labdhabodhodayā nandaṃ vande saṃsthānamātmanaḥ || 1 ||

rūpādi pañcavargoyaṃ viśvametāvadeva hi |
gṛhyate pañcabhistaśca cakṣurādi bhirindriyaiḥ || 2 ||

cakṣuḥ sarvāsvavasthāsu dehināṃ manasi sthitam |
tatpralīnaṃ bhavettasya yasya sarvaṃ pralīyate || 3 ||

tasyaiva(?) viniyopāyaḥ pradiṣṭo guruṇāparaḥ |
tadāgama mayādbhraṃśa bhayāt sṛṣṭī kṛte mayā || 4 ||

jātyādi kalpanā rūpa vyavahāro manassthitam |
yastuto na tatāssanti niścityai tacchamaṃ vrajet || 5 ||

śukraśoṇita saṃśleṣa kālenāsti manaḥ kvacit |
nābudbudo na peṣaṃ vāna śarīre kvacit sthitam || 6 ||

<p. 245b> śarīre garbhavāsānte kaumāre yauvane tathā |
kṣāya(?)kṣayivināśāntaṃ taśca naivopalabhyate || 7 ||

pṛthak māṃsaṃ pṛthag rūpaṃ lomādīnāṃ pṛthak sthitiḥ |
pṛthak sarvaṃ yathā dṛṣṭaṃ kvaśarīre mana sthitam || 8 ||

evameva vicāryokte jātistatraiva paṭhyate |
na ca sā vastuto yuktyā kasya cedvā vabhāsate || 9 ||

nāma pitrā kṛtaṃ mithyā kriyā na niyatā yataḥ |
guṇī yadi bhavet kaścid bhavanti vahavo guṇāḥ || 10 ||

itthaṃ mithyā vikalporthaṃ vāmanā bhirabhi plutam |
cañcalaṃ manaso rūpaṃ niścityai tannibodhayet || 11 ||

pūrvairnibodhaḥ kathito vairāgyā bhyāsa yogataḥ |
ayatnena nirodhoyamasmābhirupadiśyate || 12 ||

<p. 246a> grāhyayaśca bhavet kiñcit tattallīnaṃ tadā bhavet |
anyasyā grahaṇāccittaṃ svātmanyeva praśāmyati || 13 ||

yathāghanasvane sāndre krameṇa vilayaṃ gate |
tadāśraya vaśāccittaṃ tasmin kṣīṇe praśāmyati || 14 ||

yadyanmanoharaṃ kiñcicchrati gocaramāgatam |
ekāgraṃ bhāvayet tāvad yāvallīnaṃ nirodhakṛt || 15 ||

rūpādīnāṃ tathaiverthaṃ bhāvayedramaṇīyatām |
vilīnānnāsmaret paścādātmabhāvopavṛṃhitāḥ || 16 |||

evaṃ grāhyaṃ samāveśānnibodharkathito mayā |
grahaṇā deva pūrvoyamidānīṃ saṃpradṛśyate || 17 ||

grahaṇānīndriyāṇī hasamāni tu prabodhayet |
<p. 246b> pararāgātmahāniḥ syāddveṣasyo pakṣayāttathā || 18 ||

sarvarāgātma hāniḥ syāt sarvadeśāttathaiva tu |
budhavat sarvarāgī syāt sarvaduṣṭaśca bhairavaḥ || 19 ||

agrāhyamindriyaṃ śūnyaṃ svātmanyeva pralīyate |
pralīnendriya vṛttistu kevalā bhyudayodayaḥ || 20 ||

tasmāccittaṃ samādāya śūnye saṅkalpa varjite |
nistabdhendriya vṛttestu nibodhaḥ saṃprajāyate || 21 ||

jṛmbhamānasya satataṃ kṣudhāniṣṭasya yoginaḥ |
dhyāyate vā kimasyāntaḥ pratyante kevalaṃ bhavet || 22 ||

apralīna manovṛtternidrāmāśrayataḥ śanaiḥ |
viṣayā grahaṇāt sarva śirodhaḥ saṃprajāyate || 23 ||

<p. 247a> yāvataḥ padavikṣepāḥ prayatnānu vadhāraṇān |
nissaṅkalpa manovṛtteḥ paramātmā prakāśate || 24 ||

āsane pyupaviṣṭhasyakvamecittramavasthitam |
vicāryaivaṃ prayatnena nirāgāre praśāmyati || 25 ||

vāyunā spandanādīni śarīrasya karomyaham |
na ca citte sthito vāyurna vāyau cittamāsthitam || 26 ||

evaṃ vimṛśato bhāvānna kvacit saṃsthito manaḥ |
mithyaiva vṛttayastasya sarvathā kevale sthitam || 27 |

yatra yatra bhaved vāñchā bhojanādiṣu vastuṣu |
pūrayettā yathā śaktirbhavet pūrṇo nirāśrayaḥ || 28 ||

vāñchitaṃ gaditaṃ kiñcida kasmādyadivismṛtam |
<p. 147b> punastasyānu sandhānāt kṣaṇāt kaivalyamāpnuyāt || 29 ||

sthāṇuḥ syāt puruṣo vetti dūrāddṛśye vikalpate |
suniścita mateḥ kṣipraṃ nirodhaḥ saṃprajāyate || 30 ||

dṛśyaiḥ padārthairdvaṣṭāraṃ paśyed buddhyā yato dṛśaḥ |
taṃ dṛṣṭyā mokṣamāpnoti yena tad vatsa badhyate || 31 ||

ālamvya saṃvidoyatnāt sarve(?)dyaṃ na svabhāvataḥ |
tasmāt saṃviditaṃ sarvamiti saṃvinmayo bhavet || 32 ||

punarvideśapānena hṛdayaṃ pravikāsayet |
tathaiva kṣīṇavṛttiḥ syādapāne vilayaṃ gate || 33 ||

suṣumṇā pathamāśritya prasādadhvanibodhataḥ |
binduṣaṭkaparityāgācchāntabodhaḥ kṣaṇād bhavet || 34 ||

<p. 248a> vāmadakṣiṇasañcāra bindudvaya nigharṣaṇāt |
dvādaśānte mahāśaktiḥ siddhairuktā sukhāgame || 35 ||

ūrdhvamākramate vāyurutdṛ(?)tāntaḥ śamo bhavet |
puryaṣṭaka vibhedepi tathaiva manaso layaḥ || 36 ||

nidāryāsyaṃ kṣaṇaṃ sthitvā nissandigdhamanā kulam |
stambhita prāṇavṛttaistu nirodhaḥ saṃprajāyate || 37 ||

nābhi meḍhrāntare cittaṃ suratāntairvinikṣipet |
līyamāne ratānando nistaraṅgaḥ kṣaṇaṃ bhavet || 38 ||

dūrāgatasu hṛdbandhu pariṣvaṅga niṣevitam |
ānanda nirbharaṃ cittaṃ nivṛttiṃ labhate kṣaṇāt || 39 ||

dūrāduccarite śabde śabdārthā na vadhāraṇāt |
<p. 248b> sāvadhānasya tajjñānaṃ kṣīṇabodhaḥ prajāyate || 40 ||

padābhyaṅga pariṣvaṅgāccittarodhaḥ kṣayaṃ bhavet |
dṛśyānāṃ ṣāḍavādīnāṃ svalolāgre sthitiṃ kuru || 41 ||

kṣīyamāna rasānandaṃ kaivalyamupajāyate |
mālatyādiṣu gandhāṃśca tathaiva paribhāvayet || 42 ||

tadāśraya vaśāccittaṃ teṣu līneṣu līyate |
itthaṃ pratikṣaṇaṃ yasya cittamātmani līyate || 43 ||

salabdha bodho sadbhāvo jīvanmukto vidhīyate |
mīmāsāvanasiṃhasya harṣadāttasya sūnanā |
[kṛtā vāmana dattena svabodhodaryāmañjarī] || 44 ||



